{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In BattleCore Arena, compete in fast-paced, peer-to-peer battles with your friends using responsive controls that mix shooting, platforming, physics mastery, and team strategy! Team up to dash, jump, and use your trusted weapons and abilities to eject your opponents from the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy two exciting game modes with friends for short yet epic matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/extras/3b481046d7e5764c05222af60ce0175b.poster.avif?t=1739300383\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/extras/3b481046d7e5764c05222af60ce0175b.webm?t=1739300383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/extras/3b481046d7e5764c05222af60ce0175b.mp4?t=1739300383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download and play for free now!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER PHYSICS </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/extras/6bbf4c733f767117ae3e486de4648593.poster.avif?t=1739300383\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/extras/6bbf4c733f767117ae3e486de4648593.webm?t=1739300383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/extras/6bbf4c733f767117ae3e486de4648593.mp4?t=1739300383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Physics will be your greatest ally or your worst enemy! Perform mind-blowing aerial maneuvers and mix the jump, double jump, directional dash, and gravity to gain the upper hand! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DOMINATE THE ARENA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/extras/d87a2f6c18a8d88875ae574505ef5ed6.poster.avif?t=1739300383\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/extras/d87a2f6c18a8d88875ae574505ef5ed6.webm?t=1739300383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/extras/d87a2f6c18a8d88875ae574505ef5ed6.mp4?t=1739300383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Experience two unique battle modes to fight with your team or roll against them:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- BACKUP: Be the last team standing in this 3v3 Team Death Match where you share lives with your teammates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Q-BALL: Catch and keep the Q-Ball to lead your team to victory. Teamwork will be key in this highly competitive mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR OWN CORE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/extras/98fc040ddee1e7f1d074e1b4ef6ccea6.poster.avif?t=1739300383\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/extras/98fc040ddee1e7f1d074e1b4ef6ccea6.webm?t=1739300383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Personalize your Core\u2019s appearance! Choose your Armor, customize your Lights, Banner, and Elimination Explosion to impose your style. Unlock over a hundred cosmetics as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on unique weapons and abilities to be the most powerful Core of the arena. Gear up for upcoming battles and create your own playstyle by selecting a ranged weapon and other game-changer perks! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROLL WITH OR AGAINST YOUR FRIENDS </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download the game for free and host your own play sessions with your friends in peer-to-peer matches!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2613870?t=1739300383","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739300383","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739300383","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739300383","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In BattleCore Arena, compete in fast-paced, peer-to-peer battles with your friends using responsive controls that mix shooting, platforming, physics mastery, and team strategy! Team up to dash, jump, and use your trusted weapons and abilities to eject your opponents from the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy two exciting game modes with friends for short yet epic matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/extras/3b481046d7e5764c05222af60ce0175b.poster.avif?t=1739300383\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/extras/3b481046d7e5764c05222af60ce0175b.webm?t=1739300383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/extras/3b481046d7e5764c05222af60ce0175