Teamwork will be key in this highly competitive mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR OWN CORE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/extras/98fc040ddee1e7f1d074e1b4ef6ccea6.poster.avif?t=1739300383\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/extras/98fc040ddee1e7f1d074e1b4ef6ccea6.webm?t=1739300383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Personalize your Core\u2019s appearance! Choose your Armor, customize your Lights, Banner, and Elimination Explosion to impose your style. Unlock over a hundred cosmetics as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on unique weapons and abilities to be the most powerful Core of the arena. Gear up for upcoming battles and create your own playstyle by selecting a ranged weapon and other game-changer perks! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROLL WITH OR AGAINST YOUR FRIENDS </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download the game for free and host your own play sessions with your friends in peer-to-peer matches!</p>","developers":["Ubisoft Bordeaux"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Ubisoft account required (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2613870/header.jpg?t=1739300383","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2613870/826823/241f966407493ffc536bb38c